msgid "You may now enter Mistwake with a party of NPC avatars. To make use of this feature, open the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Trust</ui-edge-color></ui-color> interface located under <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Duty</ui-edge-color></ui-color> in the main menu."
